\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 580 2048SP (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4770 CPU @ 3.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen Setting the Max FPS in Project settings or via Engine.max_fps = x. \nWhen Playing it will make a tone sound with a pitch based on the Max FPS applied, Higher FPS Higher Pitch.\n\nI expect to have no sounds high pitched sounds when picking a higher fps even if a higher fps in not practical.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nstep 0: Beware Loud Tone Sounds!\nstep 1a: With Advanced mode on, Change application/run/max_fps in Project setting, to any high fps value. \nstep 1b: use this line of code Engine.max_fps = 700 - 1000 \"max\"\nstep 2: Run Program\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIts really easy to do, uhh instructions unclear on how to add it. :P ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121545/